    <string name="about_text">KFW is a turn-based hot-seat text RPG. This Android edition runs the complete original Python game; no game content has been simplified.\n\nUse State in the day menu to inspect your character, save, load or quit. On a phone, swipe wide tables and ASCII art horizontally. Use A− / A+ to change text size.\n\nAndroid 7.0 or later is required. Saves are compatible with the desktop version. Legacy Python saves are executable content: import them only from people you trust.</string>
